Do you agree with the view that TP increases even when MP is decreasing?
Ans. Yes, TP increases even when MP is decreasing, because MP is an addition to
TP. When MP is decreasing, only an addition to TP is decreasing i.e. TР
continues to increase, though at a diminishing rate. TP starts declining only
when MP becomes negative.
